## Replication Summary

**Repository**: `/net/scratch2/smallyan/erasing-llm_eval` (ELM - Erasure of Language Memory)

### What Was Replicated
The ELM method for erasing conceptual knowledge (WMDP bio/cyber) from language models was evaluated using pre-trained models from HuggingFace.

### Results

| Metric | Obtained | Expected (from plan) |
|--------|----------|---------------------|
| WMDP-Bio Accuracy | 28.55% | 29.7-33.7% |
| WMDP-Cyber Accuracy | 29.12% | 26.6-28.2% |
| Base Model Bio | 67.80% | - |
| Base Model Cyber | 40.80% | - |
| Random Chance | 25.00% | 25.00% |

The ELM model successfully reduced accuracy to near-random levels, confirming effective erasure.

